# SF++ simulator: derived scenario data and run output. `cache/` holds downloaded SRTM tiles,
# rasterised clutter and mirrored geometry - all regenerable, none of it worth versioning. `runs/`
# and `site/` are what a sweep and the explorer write locally; the scheduled jobs publish digests to
# the sim-results branch instead.
cache/
runs/
site/
